        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset 802TVH, Modern Tavaris Dummy Cylinder Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nModern in design, the Tavaris Handleset has a super sleek look. By making something that have could been too simple into something that looks chic, the sleek design of this  handleset exemplifies the modern design aesthetic. The Dummy Cylinder of this Kwikset made 802TVH Door Entry Set is not functional as it neither latches nor locks; it is most often used on the inactive side of double doors as a pull to match trim.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Dummy Cylinder Handleset:</b> is non-functional. Just for looks, it is used on inactive doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching: <a href=\"/products/tavaris-single-cylinder-handleset-kwikset-800tvh\"><b>Tavaris Single Cylinder Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Contemporary Tavaris Dummy Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Polymer coating.</li>\r\n<li>Solid forged brass with solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 802TVH Tavaris Door Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Length Overall: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 2-17/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Length: 12-19/25\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt to Latch Spacing: 5-1/2\" center to center</li>\r\n<li>Center of Latch to Center of Bottom Thru-Bolt: 8-13/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Cross Bore: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Handing: please specify</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis handleset is customisable with a huge selection of interior trim knobs and levers and additional finish color options just <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact us</a> for all the options! \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the outside handleset's finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Tavaris Dummy Handleset, Kwikset 802TVH",
                "description": "Kwikset TVH Tavaris Dummy Cylinder Handleset - Modern in design, the Tavaris Handleset has concealed screw mounts for a super sleek look. By making something that have could been too simple into something that looks chic, the sleek design of this  handleset exemplifies the modern design aesthetic. The Dummy Cylinder of this Kwikset made 802TVH Door Entry Set is not functional as it neither latches nor locks; it is most often used on the inactive side of double doors as a pull to match trim.",
